-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ז/7 (15.8.2017): תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר לשנת הלימודים תשע"ז
-- The one-time reward to high-school teaching staff for their school's
-- achievements in school year 2016-17 (section 36 of the agreement of
-- 14.8.2011): who is covered, the amount by the school's rank, pro-rating,
-- the August 2017 payment, its treatment for pay purposes, and the owners'
-- indemnification.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ז/7 — תגמול בגין הישגי בית הספר תשע"ז`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, the date (15.8.2017), the reference number, the addressee, the subject, and the recitals: the general collective agreement of 14.8.2011 (approved by the Treasury's wage director), its Oz LaTmura provisions, and this circular's purpose; the rule they introduce is encoded under section 1.

DECLARE `reward action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the achievement reward` HAS `reward amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `indemnify the owner` HAS `indemnity paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 תחולה`

@desc A high-school teaching employee's school year 2016-17, as far as the reward asks about it.
DECLARE `reward case` HAS
    `graded as a teaching employee in the high school` IS A BOOLEAN @desc graded on the teaching employees' scale and working in the upper division (grades 9 or 10 to 12/14)
    `employed by a supervised post-primary owner`      IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of post-primary education supervised by the Ministry of Education
    `school rank`                                      IS A NUMBER  @desc the school's rank as the ministry found it (1 to 4); 0 for a school not ranked
    `high-school position fraction`                    IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position in the upper division (1 = 100%)
    `months employed in the year`                      IS A NUMBER  @desc months of the school year employed at the excelling institution, counting maternity leave under the Women's Employment Law
    `on full sabbatical or full unpaid leave`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc on sabbatical or unpaid leave for the whole school year

-- §1 and the recitals: every teaching employee in the upper division at a
-- supervised post-primary owner, per the share of the employment there,
-- whether under Oz LaTmura or not yet joined to it.
@ref akn:art_1 akn:preamble/p15
GIVEN c IS A `reward case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the circular` c IF
    c's `graded as a teaching employee in the high school` AND c's `employed by a supervised post-primary owner`

§§ `2 תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר`

-- §2א: the program rewarding teachers for their school's achievements in
-- the upper divisions runs from 2012-13, by the format and rules of the
-- pedagogical administration's letter of 21.10.2012; which schools rank is
-- decided under those rules (an input: the case's school rank).
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `reward case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school ranks under the rules of the letter of 21.10.2012` c IF
    c's `school rank` AT LEAST 1 AND c's `school rank` AT MOST 4

-- §2ב: teachers in the upper divisions whose achievements the ministry
-- found to be the highest are entitled to a one-time grant, by the table:
-- the grant for a full position, by the school's rank (each rank a further
-- 10% of the schools), updated to May 2017 by the consumer price index
-- against May 2016.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b
@export default The one-time achievement grant a high-school teaching employee is owed for school year 2016-17 under owners' circular 2016-17/7
GIVEN c IS A `reward case` @desc the teacher's year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `achievement reward` c IS
    IF `entitled to the one-time grant` c
    THEN `the full-position reward for rank` (c's `school rank`) TIMES `the reward share` c
    ELSE 0

GIVEN c IS A `reward case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the one-time grant` c IF
        `covered by the circular` c
    AND `the school ranks under the rules of the letter of 21.10.2012` c
    AND NOT `not entitled after a full sabbatical or full unpaid leave` c

DECLARE `reward row` HAS
    `reward rank`   IS A NUMBER
    `reward amount` IS A NUMBER

`the reward table` MEANS
    LIST `reward row` 1 8285.23,
         `reward row` 2 6213.92,
         `reward row` 3 4142.61,
         `reward row` 4 3106.96

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position reward for rank` n IS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `reward amount`)
             (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `reward rank` EQUALS n) `the reward table`))

-- §2ג: pro rata to the high-school position and/or to the share of the year
-- employed at the excelling institution (maternity leave counts as
-- employment; unpaid leave after it does not), with §2ד's cap on the
-- position counted.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c
GIVEN c IS A `reward case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reward share` c IS
    min (c's `high-school position fraction`) `the most position counted`
    TIMES min (c's `months employed in the year` DIVIDED BY 12) 1

-- §2ג ¶2: for the avoidance of doubt, a teacher on a full sabbatical or
-- full unpaid leave in 2016-17 is not entitled to the reward.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c/p2
GIVEN c IS A `reward case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `not entitled after a full sabbatical or full unpaid leave` c IF
    c's `on full sabbatical or full unpaid leave`

-- §2ד: employment beyond 100% of a position is not counted.
@ref akn:art_2__para_d
`the most position counted` MEANS 1

-- §2ה: paid with August 2017's salary (school month 12).
@ref akn:art_2__para_e
GIVEN c IS A `reward case`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reward action`
DECIDE `paying the grants with August 2017's salary` c IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the achievement reward` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `achievement reward` c
    WITHIN 12
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2016-17/7 section 2e: the grants are paid with August 2017's salary"

-- §2ו: not in the base for the hourly value, severance pay or percentage
-- supplements, and no training-fund contributions are made on them.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f
DECLARE `pay purpose` IS ONE OF
    `the hourly value`
    `severance pay`
    `percentage supplements`
    `training-fund contributions`

GIVEN p IS A `pay purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grants are left out of` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `the hourly value` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `severance pay` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `percentage supplements` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `training-fund contributions` THEN TRUE

-- §2ז: pension-fund contributions of 5% by the employer and 5% deducted from
-- the teacher's salary. The corpus prints ¶2 with its words in reverse
-- order ("לתגמולים. המורה ממשכורת ניכוי - 5% – ו לתגמולים מעסיק",
-- MMS-426), but the two rates it prints are both 5%, so no pairing of the
-- rates with the employer's contribution and the teacher's deduction gives
-- another figure: the text is usable as printed.
@ref akn:art_2__para_g akn:art_2__para_g/p2
`the employer's pension contribution rate` MEANS 0.05
`the teacher's pension deduction rate` MEANS 0.05

GIVEN c IS A `reward case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employer's pension contribution on the reward` c IS
    `achievement reward` c TIMES `the employer's pension contribution rate`

GIVEN c IS A `reward case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the teacher's pension deduction on the reward` c IS
    `achievement reward` c TIMES `the teacher's pension deduction rate`

-- akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p2 A link to the list of the winning schools for 2016-17; the rank is an input of each case.

-- §4: the owners are indemnified in the payment system (topic 583) in
-- August 2017's payments, transferred at the start of 9/2017 (school month
-- 13 counted from September 2016).
@ref akn:art_4
GIVEN `rewards paid by the owner` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reward action`
DECIDE `indemnifying the owner` `rewards paid by the owner` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `indemnify the owner` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `rewards paid by the owner`
    WITHIN 13
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "circular 2016-17/7: the owners are indemnified in August 2017's payments, transferred at the start of 9/2017"

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, the signature (Sonia Peretz) and the list of copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

`a full-position teacher at a rank-2 school` MEANS
    `reward case` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee in the high school` IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised post-primary owner`      IS TRUE
        `school rank`                                      IS 2
        `high-school position fraction`                    IS 1.2
        `months employed in the year`                      IS 12
        `on full sabbatical or full unpaid leave`          IS FALSE

`a half-position teacher for half the year at a rank-1 school` MEANS
    `reward case` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee in the high school` IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised post-primary owner`      IS TRUE
        `school rank`                                      IS 1
        `high-school position fraction`                    IS 0.5
        `months employed in the year`                      IS 6
        `on full sabbatical or full unpaid leave`          IS FALSE

`a teacher on a full sabbatical` MEANS
    `reward case` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee in the high school` IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised post-primary owner`      IS TRUE
        `school rank`                                      IS 1
        `high-school position fraction`                    IS 1
        `months employed in the year`                      IS 0
        `on full sabbatical or full unpaid leave`          IS TRUE

#ASSERT `achievement reward` `a full-position teacher at a rank-2 school` EQUALS 6213.92
#ASSERT `achievement reward` `a half-position teacher for half the year at a rank-1 school` EQUALS 2071.3075
#ASSERT `achievement reward` `a teacher on a full sabbatical` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the full-position reward for rank` 5 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the grants are left out of` `severance pay`
#ASSERT `the employer's pension contribution on the reward` `a full-position teacher at a rank-2 school` EQUALS 6213.92 TIMES 0.05
#ASSERT `the teacher's pension deduction on the reward` `a full-position teacher at a rank-2 school` EQUALS 6213.92 TIMES 0.05

#TRACE `paying the grants with August 2017's salary` `a full-position teacher at a rank-2 school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the achievement reward` 6213.92 AT 12
#TRACE `indemnifying the owner` 6213.92 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `indemnify the owner` 6213.92 AT 13

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over a finite space: covered or not; school ranks 0 to 5;
-- high-school positions in tenths from 0 to 1.5; months employed 0 to 12;
-- on a full sabbatical or not.

`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`tenths to 1.5` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 10) (range 0 15)

GIVEN g IS A BOOLEAN, r IS A NUMBER, p IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, s IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `reward case`
DECIDE `a checked case` g r p m s IS
    `reward case` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee in the high school` IS g
        `employed by a supervised post-primary owner`      IS TRUE
        `school rank`                                      IS r
        `high-school position fraction`                    IS p
        `months employed in the year`                      IS m
        `on full sabbatical or full unpaid leave`          IS s

-- §2ב's table: each rank 1 to 4 has exactly one row, and the reward falls
-- from each rank to the next.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    count (filter (GIVEN row YIELD row's `reward rank` EQUALS n) `the reward table`) EQUALS 1
                AND (n EQUALS 4 OR `the full-position reward for rank` (n PLUS 1) LESS THAN `the full-position reward for rank` n))
            (range 1 4)

GIVEN c IS A `reward case`, g IS A BOOLEAN, r IS A NUMBER, p IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, s IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 2 holds for` c g r p m s IF
    LET x MEANS `achievement reward` c
    IN      x AT LEAST 0
        AND x AT MOST `the full-position reward for rank` 1
        AND (x GREATER THAN 0) EQUALS (g AND r AT LEAST 1 AND r AT MOST 4 AND p GREATER THAN 0 AND m GREATER THAN 0 AND NOT s)
        AND x AT MOST `achievement reward` (`a checked case` g r (p PLUS 0.1) m s)
        AND x AT MOST `achievement reward` (`a checked case` g r p (m PLUS 1) s)
        AND ((p LESS THAN 1) OR x EQUALS `achievement reward` (`a checked case` g r (p PLUS 0.5) m s))
        AND `the employer's pension contribution on the reward` c EQUALS x TIMES 0.05

-- §§1-2 over the whole space: the reward is never negative, never above
-- rank 1's full amount, something exactly for a covered teacher at a ranked
-- school with a position and a month and not on a full sabbatical, never
-- falling with a larger position or another month, paying above a full
-- position as one (§2ד), and carrying the employer's 5%.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN r YIELD
                        all (GIVEN p YIELD
                                all (GIVEN m YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN s YIELD
                                                `section 2 holds for` (`a checked case` g r p m s) g r p m s)
                                            `both booleans`)
                                    (range 0 12))
                            `tenths to 1.5`)
                    (range 0 5))
            `both booleans`

-- §2ו: the grants are left out of every purpose it names.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN q YIELD `the grants are left out of` q)
            (LIST `the hourly value`, `severance pay`, `percentage supplements`, `training-fund contributions`)

-- §2ז: the employer's contribution and the teacher's deduction are equal.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                LET c MEANS `a checked case` TRUE r 1 12 FALSE
                IN  `the employer's pension contribution on the reward` c EQUALS `the teacher's pension deduction on the reward` c)
            (range 0 5)
